{"ID":"20240205153836-rodfu7z","Spec":"1","Type":"NodeDocument","Properties":{"custom-sy-readonly":"true","id":"20240205153836-rodfu7z","scroll":"\u0026#123;\u0026quot;rootId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240205153836-rodfu7z\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;startId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240206135325-mjipxqt\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;endId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240612095054-m3fx2q2\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;scrollTop\u0026quot;:0,\u0026quot;focusId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240626094700-uyf7tm3\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;focusStart\u0026quot;:3,\u0026quot;focusEnd\u0026quot;:3\u0026#125;","title":"212秦皮","type":"doc","updated":"20240821110406"},"Children":[{"ID":"20240206135325-mjipxqt","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240206135325-mjipxqt","updated":"20240206135341"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【产地】\t主产东北地区。\n【性状】\t枝皮：呈卷筒状或槽状，长1060cm，厚1.53mm。外表面灰白色、灰棕色至黑棕色或相间呈斑状，平坦或稍粗糙，并有灰白色圆点状皮孔及细斜皱纹，有的具分枝痕；内表面黄白色或棕色，平滑。质硬而脆，断面纤维性，黄白色。无臭，味苦。\n干皮：为长条状块片，厚3"},{"Type":"NodeBackslash","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeBackslashContent","Data":"~"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"6mm。外表面灰棕色，有红棕色圆形或横长的皮孔及龟裂状沟纹。质坚硬，断面纤维性较强。\n【性味】\t苦，寒。\n【功效】\t清热燥湿，清肝明目，收涩止痢，止带。用于热毒泻痢，带下阴痒，肝热目赤肿痛，目生翳障。"}]},{"ID":"20240206135326-ixu27nr","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240206135326-ixu27nr","updated":"20240206135326"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"image"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/image-20240206135326-dlx5n4t.png"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240205155812-hdd8e3l","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240205155812-hdd8e3l","updated":"20240205155812"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"秦皮"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/秦皮-20240205155812-jv8e94h.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240205155812-51lon6w","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240205155812-51lon6w","updated":"20240205155812"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"秦皮2"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/秦皮2-20240205155812-vbbebft.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240626094238-vxp6mos","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240626094238-vxp6mos","updated":"20240821104604"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 376px;","style":"width: 366px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"image"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/image-20240626094458-r098oko.png"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 366px;\" parent-style=\"width: 376px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 400px;","style":"width: 390px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"秦皮"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/秦皮-20240626094238-a4q9l68.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 390px;\" parent-style=\"width: 400px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 501px;","style":"width: 491px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"秦皮"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/秦皮-20240821104604-2xl9l2y.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 491px;\" parent-style=\"width: 501px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240821104648-fnj4pq5","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240821104648-fnj4pq5","updated":"20240821104655"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 518px;","style":"width: 508px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"秦皮 (1)"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/秦皮 1-20240821104648-pp42i8p.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 508px;\" parent-style=\"width: 518px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 711px;","style":"width: 701px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"秦皮4"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/秦皮4-20240626094745-1zr33ly.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 701px;\" parent-style=\"width: 711px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240626094420-ji0ml39","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240626094420-ji0ml39","updated":"20240821104920"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 584px;","style":"width: 574px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"秦皮3"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/秦皮3-20240626094420-ky8oiiq.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 574px;\" parent-style=\"width: